Everything in these directories is GENERATED from the YAML records in content/
by the Astro build (`npm run build`, see astro.config.mjs):

    user-groups/   community-days/   student-builder-groups/   _assets/

DO NOT EDIT THESE FILES. Edit the matching YAML record in content/ and run
`npm run build`; the CI job .github/workflows/build-generated-pages.yml rebuilds
and diffs every one of those directories against a fresh build, so a hand edit
or a forgotten rebuild fails the check.

These files are committed because the deployment pipeline syncs this repository
to S3 verbatim and has no build step of its own. See docs/deployment.md.
